  {
    "file": "R:\\Music\\Vombatus\\Tombeau\\04 Les Barricades (What I Don't Say).mp3",
    "text": {
      "TXXX": "lyrics-eng\u0000[Rondeau | harpsichord alone, broken chords circling gently in 3/4, B flat major]\n[Couplet | clean tapped guitar takes the pattern, harpsichord answers, warm and interlocking]\n[Rondeau | the opening theme returns exactly as before]\n[Couplet | piano and cello join, richer, still circling, a faint static drone appears underneath]\n[Rondeau | the theme returns again, unchanged, while the drone grows]\n[Couplet | the loveliest section, guitar and harpsichord in full flow, the drone now clearly audible]\n[Outro | the theme one last time, gentle and untroubled, the drone louder than the melody, then cut] | comment\u0000made with suno; created=2026-09-16T21:12:59Z; id=c357fa38-8e25-466d-be7d-0332367d73d9",
      "TIT2": "Les Barricades (What I Don't Say)",
